  "name": "Italian Spaghetti Sauce",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, vegetable-rich tomato sauce",
  "description": "Build a savory tomato sauce with aromatics, vegetables, and dried herbs, then pressure-cook and blend it until smooth.",
